    "body": "When I run the tests, I can't find the xpath for the majority of the errors, it seems that the cookie banner is causing the issue, I think we need to set the cookie before we run the tests\r\n\r\nOn this url you can see the issue:\r\n\r\na11y http://www.test.bbc.co.uk/news/front_page_beta\r\n\r\nAny of the errors with div[7] you cannot find the xpath, this is the cookie div. If we set the cookie before running the tests as part of the process I believe this should resolve the issue.\r\n\r\n",
